>*
To use code from other library we have to import it
the way to import it is with middle processor command
#get name

> NOTE: for this to work you have to execute this in correct folder
if you try to execute it from root of repo it'll not work

*<

#get LIBCODE.dio

#namespace notLib

>>defining namespace AFTER importing (importing could change your namespace!!)

>>We know that the library uses namespace 'lib' and that it defines
>>public functio 'libraryFunc()', we can now call it as:

lib->libraryFunc()